# Valve Steam Web API Configuration
#
# 1. STEAM_API_KEY:
#    Register and obtain your Steam Web API Key from Valve:
#    https://steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey
#    IMPORTANT: Keep this key strictly server-side. Never prefix with PUBLIC_ or expose to client bundles.
#
# 2. STEAM_ID64:
#    Your 17-digit numeric 64-bit Steam ID (e.g. 76561198000000000).
#    Find yours at: https://steamid.io or from your Steam community profile URL.
#
# 3. Privacy Settings:
#    Ensure your Steam Profile and Game Details are set to "Public" in Steam Privacy Settings
#    (Steam -> Settings -> Privacy Settings -> My profile: Public, Game details: Public)
#    otherwise Valve's API will not return owned games or current activity.

STEAM_API_KEY=your_steam_web_api_key_here
STEAM_ID64=76561198000000000
